Chapter: AgentBundleAuthorTest
  cites Works chapter AgentBundle
  cites Foreword chapter Ed25519
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 The genuine manifest is the AGENT.MAN of codex/test/apps/bundled-agent.disk-mint, signed by the demo author key.
 The forgery keeps its every line but the key: a stranger's key (seed 32 bytes of 7) replaces it and signs the
 result, which is a valid Ed25519 signature that authenticates nobody the device trusts.

